WEBVTT

00:02.030 --> 00:04.330
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.470 --> 00:07.490
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.000 --> 00:10.740
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.740 --> 00:15.370
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.810 --> 00:22.770
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.520 --> 00:27.390
Dragon Drive

00:27.390 --> 00:32.880
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.030 --> 00:36.000
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.000 --> 00:39.230
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.730 --> 00:44.110
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.110 --> 00:46.070
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.070 --> 00:52.380
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.120 --> 00:56.480
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.480 --> 00:59.680
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.020 --> 01:05.030
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.030 --> 01:06.580
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.730 --> 01:09.130
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.130 --> 01:12.260
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.670 --> 01:17.740
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.740 --> 01:20.480
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.480 --> 01:28.580
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:41.400 --> 01:45.770
Not a single soul shall be allowed
to enter the Shrine where Shinryu rests...

01:46.970 --> 01:48.270
...you fools!

01:54.180 --> 01:55.900
We'll have you return Daisuke to us!

01:56.140 --> 01:57.130
Not a chance!

02:04.750 --> 02:06.190
Everyone! Get outta here!

02:16.660 --> 02:20.100
The Truth

02:36.950 --> 02:38.320
Where am I?

02:40.090 --> 02:41.060
I see!

02:41.760 --> 02:43.350
I've been sucked into this place!

02:44.260 --> 02:46.120
Okay, Chibi! Let's get outta here!

02:46.430 --> 02:47.520
Wait!

02:50.870 --> 02:53.530
Shouldn't you finish fighting me first?

02:58.170 --> 02:59.370
That's good.

02:59.440 --> 03:01.530
Otherwise, you'd hardly be a hero.

03:02.510 --> 03:03.530
Here I come!

03:22.600 --> 03:24.190
What's wrong with Kouhei?

03:24.330 --> 03:26.270
He's acting strangely.

03:27.100 --> 03:29.930
No, he might be planning
to catch me off guard.

03:37.810 --> 03:38.800
Run, Kouhei!

03:46.990 --> 03:47.920
Kouhei!

03:48.490 --> 03:49.890
Can't you see?!

03:52.790 --> 03:54.230
I guess my secret is out!

03:54.630 --> 03:56.290
Actually, you're right!

03:58.500 --> 04:01.400
You're not just acting blind
as part of a plan, are you?!

04:01.870 --> 04:03.800
Then why not test me?

04:05.940 --> 04:06.910
Stop it!

04:13.150 --> 04:14.240
Kouhei.

04:14.850 --> 04:18.180
Reiji Ohzora. You win.

04:19.390 --> 04:21.910
There's no way I can beat you
like this.

04:22.720 --> 04:24.120
He's right. Right now...

04:24.190 --> 04:27.490
...I could defeat Kouhei
and get back the Dragonite.

04:27.960 --> 04:29.260
But...

04:29.960 --> 04:31.760
Kouhei's injured!

04:33.130 --> 04:35.260
Is it right to fight against him now?!

04:36.140 --> 04:37.730
Get it over with.

04:41.480 --> 04:43.440
I can't fight you like this.

04:43.910 --> 04:46.440
That's the response I expected.

04:46.780 --> 04:48.370
You're such a goody-two-shoes.

04:48.680 --> 04:49.620
What?!

04:50.650 --> 04:51.780
Did that piss you off?

04:52.290 --> 04:54.780
Now that you're angry,
I have a favor to ask.

04:54.990 --> 04:56.790
Wh-What is it?!

05:00.030 --> 05:01.890
Finish me off.

05:04.000 --> 05:09.130
RI-ON has no place for anyone
who's failed in his mission.

05:11.710 --> 05:16.440
I don't wanna run away to Rikyu
just to survive like Meguru did.

05:16.940 --> 05:19.380
And I don't have any friends who'd help me.

05:20.620 --> 05:21.580
Kouhei.

05:23.350 --> 05:25.580
I got this far all on my own, but...

05:26.890 --> 05:28.650
...I guess it's "game over".

05:31.160 --> 05:33.750
Hang in there, Daisuke! Maiko!

05:46.410 --> 05:47.810
Maiko!

05:49.280 --> 05:50.510
Daisuke.

05:59.720 --> 06:01.190
Maiko!

06:11.630 --> 06:14.360
You fools in search of Shinryu!

06:14.700 --> 06:18.000
You shall sink into
the sea of darkness with me!

06:21.910 --> 06:22.880
Rockaku!

06:23.310 --> 06:25.540
This time we settle things once and for all!

06:26.110 --> 06:28.210
I told you we'd do that later!

06:28.680 --> 06:29.650
Shut up!

06:37.020 --> 06:37.960
Hikaru!

06:38.360 --> 06:40.190
Help out Maiko and the others!

06:40.260 --> 06:41.890
I'll be there shortly!

06:46.470 --> 06:47.900
I won't let you go!

06:50.570 --> 06:52.330
Don't get in my way!

06:54.510 --> 06:55.910
Go! Hikaru!

06:56.810 --> 06:58.070
Please go!

07:04.020 --> 07:05.880
Why?! Why did you protect me?!

07:05.950 --> 07:07.390
When you watched my brother die!

07:07.720 --> 07:08.920
Why, Rockaku?!

07:19.300 --> 07:21.270
Why'd you join RI-ON?

07:23.200 --> 07:24.760
What good will it do you to know?

07:25.070 --> 07:27.270
I want to know more about you.

07:27.680 --> 07:29.270
About me?

07:29.540 --> 07:31.270
We're enemies, remember?!

07:31.380 --> 07:33.010
Or are you gathering information on me?

07:33.450 --> 07:35.940
That's not it! That's not why I asked!

07:39.590 --> 07:40.950
I'll tell you.

07:42.090 --> 07:44.680
I had nowhere else to go.

07:45.390 --> 07:48.120
I had no family, and no friends either...

07:48.700 --> 07:51.190
Well, not that you'd believe me, anyway.

07:51.400 --> 07:52.460
Kouhei.

07:52.670 --> 07:53.960
But it's true.

07:54.670 --> 07:58.130
I was always alone
until the day that Dad took me in.

07:58.810 --> 08:01.370
And that's why you're helping RI-ON?

08:03.310 --> 08:07.210
Do you think that
if I'd met you earlier...

08:08.120 --> 08:10.080
...we could have become friends?

08:11.220 --> 08:13.980
Kouhei! Let's fight together!

08:16.720 --> 08:17.780
That's impossible.

08:17.930 --> 08:20.360
For one, that old man on your team
who's out to get me...

08:20.430 --> 08:21.860
There's no way he'd go for it.

08:21.930 --> 08:25.060
I'm sure that if you wanna join us for real,
Rockaku will forgive you!

08:25.400 --> 08:26.630
Come on, Kouhei!

08:32.540 --> 08:34.940
Can I... trust you?

08:35.480 --> 08:36.440
Sure.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.520
Kouhei.

09:12.510 --> 09:13.480
Hikaru.

09:17.790 --> 09:19.880
That has absolutely no effect on me.

09:22.320 --> 09:23.290
Stop it!

09:23.760 --> 09:25.120
You mustn't attack!

09:26.530 --> 09:29.290
That thing has Daisuke inside it.

09:30.260 --> 09:32.390
If you attack it, you attack Daisuke, too.

09:32.900 --> 09:35.530
What difference does it make
if he's around or not?

09:35.940 --> 09:36.870
Hikaru!

09:39.470 --> 09:41.130
I'll make it quick and painless.

09:42.480 --> 09:44.100
I'm telling you, DON'T!

09:44.880 --> 09:46.070
Then what do you suggest?

09:46.780 --> 09:48.270
If only Reiji were here...

09:49.050 --> 09:50.020
What?

09:50.690 --> 09:54.620
Only a dragon with sacred powers
can defeat the power of darkness.

09:54.920 --> 09:56.010
In other words...

09:56.090 --> 09:57.960
Right. Chibi could do it.

10:36.930 --> 10:38.130
Fire, Chibi!

10:45.870 --> 10:47.640
I'm gonna smoke the dragon out!

10:49.380 --> 10:50.470
Stop it, Kouhei!

10:51.210 --> 10:53.810
This dragon won't attack
if we don't do anything!

10:54.180 --> 10:56.150
I'll break the crystals and stir things up!

10:56.320 --> 10:58.840
It'll only attack what's moving...

10:58.920 --> 11:01.650
...so I'll draw its attention
and lure it out!

11:04.530 --> 11:05.580
Kouhei!

11:19.940 --> 11:21.700
Kouhei! There it is!

11:22.340 --> 11:25.010
Finish it off with one blow, Reiji!

11:25.080 --> 11:25.910
Right!

11:25.980 --> 11:27.500
Chibi! We'll use SinnSaber!

11:28.220 --> 11:31.120
SinnSaber!

12:03.320 --> 12:04.280
Kouhei!

12:12.430 --> 12:13.390
Kouhei!

12:20.370 --> 12:22.340
It was still alive?

12:22.540 --> 12:23.900
It sure was.

12:26.810 --> 12:30.770
Kouhei! That's great! You can see again!

12:31.410 --> 12:33.110
Thanks to you.

12:37.250 --> 12:39.340
I won't let you get away, Rockaku!

12:40.020 --> 12:42.580
I haven't got the time to
play around with you!

12:47.700 --> 12:48.890
What?!

12:54.700 --> 12:56.400
D-Damn it.

13:01.840 --> 13:04.680
Sorry, Mahiru. I've gotta hurry.

13:09.420 --> 13:10.780
Maiko!

13:11.750 --> 13:12.720
Kouhei.

13:12.990 --> 13:15.460
I've gotta go and help them.
Please come with me!

13:17.790 --> 13:20.120
Kouhei! What's wrong?

13:20.530 --> 13:21.830
You will come with me, won't you?

13:22.530 --> 13:24.430
Why should I?

13:24.500 --> 13:26.130
It's none of my concern!

13:26.770 --> 13:28.560
Are you gonna abandon our friends?

13:28.640 --> 13:29.760
Friends?

13:30.670 --> 13:32.830
The situation has changed!

13:32.970 --> 13:34.440
You understand, don't you?

13:34.510 --> 13:35.840
You tricked me.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.710
I didn't trick you!

13:37.880 --> 13:39.870
Things have gone back to how they were.

13:40.050 --> 13:42.170
So, I'm continuing the game!

13:42.380 --> 13:43.650
It's easy as that!

13:44.050 --> 13:45.420
Kouhei!

13:45.490 --> 13:46.850
Think about it.

13:46.920 --> 13:50.550
If you and I became friends,
what sorta game would this be?

13:52.060 --> 13:55.120
I'm getting the final item
and returning to Earth.

13:55.300 --> 13:57.200
Then I'll win this game!

13:57.430 --> 13:59.400
I won't let you go! Chibi!

14:00.840 --> 14:04.400
Kouhei! I won't let you have Shinryu
or the Dragonite!

14:06.610 --> 14:08.840
You sure you wanna fight me?

14:08.980 --> 14:12.670
Your precious friends
may not survive much longer.

14:15.280 --> 14:17.610
What do you wanna do?

14:17.850 --> 14:20.340
If you're gonna fire, go ahead and fire!
Mr. Good-For-Nothing!

14:24.190 --> 14:26.820
Damn it!!

14:28.630 --> 14:31.620
Well, well. He really left.

14:33.070 --> 14:34.590
Way to go, brother.

14:35.600 --> 14:37.940
You used Reiji Ohzora.

14:39.370 --> 14:41.310
Hey, Hideaki.

14:42.210 --> 14:45.040
Let's go. Our goal is within sight.

14:57.020 --> 14:58.360
The time has finally come.

14:59.090 --> 15:00.820
Stabilize the coordinates.

15:01.260 --> 15:04.360
Have them return
as soon as they get Shinryu.

15:04.770 --> 15:07.260
Immediately. Understand?

15:07.330 --> 15:08.300
Yes.

15:16.110 --> 15:17.200
Are you all okay?!

15:17.650 --> 15:18.610
Reiji!

15:18.710 --> 15:19.680
Reiji!

15:21.080 --> 15:23.520
I'll bury you in the darkness with the others!

15:23.820 --> 15:25.510
D-Daisuke.

15:30.520 --> 15:32.290
That dragon is a dragon of darkness!

15:32.430 --> 15:35.920
Chibi and his sacred powers can defeat it.

15:36.360 --> 15:37.420
All right.

15:37.700 --> 15:39.790
Chibi! We're gonna save everyone!

15:44.970 --> 15:45.940
Damn you!

15:50.780 --> 15:52.140
Return to darkness!

15:54.650 --> 15:56.210
Chibi! One more time!

16:07.260 --> 16:08.230
Kanper!

16:15.400 --> 16:16.490
Daisuke!

16:17.710 --> 16:19.640
You must not open the Shrine!

16:20.010 --> 16:23.970
If anyone blinded by a lust for power
were to break the seal of Shinryu...

16:24.750 --> 16:26.510
...this world would cease to exist.

16:27.280 --> 16:28.910
Not even darkness will remain.

16:28.980 --> 16:30.470
All will vanish.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.550
Don't worry.

16:33.620 --> 16:37.250
I promise that I will never
allow Shinryu to resurrect.

16:42.030 --> 16:43.160
Daisuke!

16:59.450 --> 17:00.410
Well...

17:00.810 --> 17:03.310
We must figure out a way to find it.

17:03.550 --> 17:06.520
So there are things that even you don't know.

17:07.650 --> 17:09.180
How about something like this?

17:15.460 --> 17:16.430
Bingo!

17:16.630 --> 17:17.650
What's that?

17:18.930 --> 17:21.030
So that's Shinryu.

17:37.250 --> 17:40.850
Now I have the last item.

17:42.220 --> 17:44.280
Shinryu is inside that.

17:45.830 --> 17:47.990
It has finally become my own.

17:48.630 --> 17:51.430
I can't tell you how long
I've waited for this moment.

17:52.100 --> 17:54.090
The world will now change.

17:54.670 --> 17:57.300
This will mark the beginning of a new era.

17:59.470 --> 18:01.770
You talk like Dad.

18:11.420 --> 18:13.180
I don't see those two anywhere.

18:13.350 --> 18:14.650
They must still be inside!

18:14.890 --> 18:15.910
What do you think?

18:15.990 --> 18:17.890
Right now, we can defeat them!

18:17.990 --> 18:19.860
Too bad!

18:24.630 --> 18:27.600
Looks like I win, Reiji Ohzora.

18:31.840 --> 18:33.100
Kouhei!!

18:34.240 --> 18:35.370
Hey, old man.

18:35.440 --> 18:37.210
This time, it's goodbye for good.

18:37.440 --> 18:41.310
Sorry you couldn't avenge
the death of your friend.

18:41.650 --> 18:42.550
Shut up!

18:43.050 --> 18:45.040
Should you be talking to me like that?

18:45.390 --> 18:47.790
I could resurrect Shinryu, you know.

18:48.260 --> 18:49.780
Please, you have to stop Rockaku!

18:49.860 --> 18:51.050
Hayate Slash!

18:53.190 --> 18:55.890
Let go! He's obviously bluffing!

18:56.100 --> 18:57.530
No, Rockaku!

18:57.630 --> 19:00.260
Shinryu IS in that Dragonite!

19:00.400 --> 19:01.200
What?!

19:01.370 --> 19:02.930
You're in my way.

19:03.100 --> 19:04.970
Move aside.

19:05.540 --> 19:07.940
Or else I really will revive it.

19:08.180 --> 19:10.510
Kouhei! You've got no where to go!

19:10.680 --> 19:12.740
Just hand over that Dragonite!

19:13.050 --> 19:16.570
Oh, my. And we were fighting together
just a little while ago.

19:17.780 --> 19:19.650
Why the cold shoulder all of a sudden?

19:19.790 --> 19:22.310
There's no way I'm letting you return to Earth!

19:23.590 --> 19:24.720
Are you sure you can stop me?

19:24.790 --> 19:25.880
I'll do what I can!

19:26.560 --> 19:27.530
Kouhei!

19:27.830 --> 19:29.460
You're just in time!

19:29.700 --> 19:31.490
Go ahead with your revenge battle!

19:31.570 --> 19:33.290
I'll help!

19:39.270 --> 19:41.760
Mahiru, don't just stand there!
Work with me!

19:43.810 --> 19:46.280
You really are completely useless.

19:46.680 --> 19:48.480
Well, I can't take you with me anyway.

19:54.790 --> 19:55.950
R-Rockaku.

19:56.760 --> 19:59.280
Wow. You're giving it quite the effort.

19:59.760 --> 20:01.630
Then how about this?

20:04.400 --> 20:05.870
Outta the way, Rockaku!

20:05.930 --> 20:07.130
No way!

20:07.270 --> 20:08.230
Rockaku!

20:10.440 --> 20:11.400
What?!

20:16.780 --> 20:18.770
Looks like I made it just in time.

20:19.150 --> 20:20.550
K-Kyoji!

20:21.520 --> 20:23.480
I'm here too!

20:23.980 --> 20:26.710
Long time no see, Sayaka.

20:27.020 --> 20:28.280
Kouhei!

20:28.660 --> 20:30.210
You're here at just the right time.

20:30.360 --> 20:32.330
Wanna return to Earth with me?

20:32.390 --> 20:33.720
Really?!

20:34.030 --> 20:34.960
Sayaka!

20:36.000 --> 20:37.990
Tell me one thing before you go.

20:38.270 --> 20:39.790
Huh? What?

20:40.270 --> 20:43.760
You'd been to Rikyu
before we ever arrived, hadn't you?

20:43.900 --> 20:46.900
Kyoji! What's the point of this?!

20:47.270 --> 20:49.000
This has nothing to do with you!

20:50.010 --> 20:53.170
And when you were here,
you fought some people, didn't you?

20:53.580 --> 20:54.950
I sure did.

20:55.020 --> 20:58.920
I fought that weak, old man over there,
and a guy who looked just like Mahiru!

20:59.250 --> 21:00.220
What?!

21:00.820 --> 21:03.150
But that fight was no fun at all!

21:03.360 --> 21:05.260
That old man ran away...

21:05.330 --> 21:07.950
...and the guy who looked like Mahiru
blew himself up.

21:09.260 --> 21:10.230
Huh?

21:10.660 --> 21:12.500
What was he to you, Mahiru?

21:13.630 --> 21:15.000
H-He was my brother!

21:15.370 --> 21:19.600
Really? What a small world.

21:19.870 --> 21:22.600
Then my brother died because of... Kouhei.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.810
You forgot the "Mister", Mahiru.

21:25.980 --> 21:27.210
Kouhei!

21:29.350 --> 21:31.150
Rockaku!

21:37.820 --> 21:41.160
Father. We'll be home shortly.

21:56.610 --> 21:59.270
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.350 --> 22:02.040
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.120 --> 22:06.050
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.520 --> 22:10.220
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.290 --> 22:12.450
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.930 --> 22:17.020
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.470 --> 22:21.060
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.130 --> 22:23.800
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.870 --> 22:27.830
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.180 --> 22:31.610
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.680 --> 22:34.610
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.680 --> 22:39.550
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.220 --> 22:42.880
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.960 --> 22:45.650
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.730 --> 22:50.360
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.100 --> 22:53.790
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.870 --> 22:56.460
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.540 --> 23:01.170
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.840 --> 23:06.340
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.280 --> 23:12.950
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.360 --> 23:17.980
Next time

23:18.190 --> 23:21.420
What'll we do?! Kouhei now has Shinryu!

23:21.500 --> 23:22.290
We're in trouble!

23:22.360 --> 23:24.190
And now, a hole in space-time has formed!

23:24.260 --> 23:26.820
At this rate, they'll be
running off with Shinryu!

23:26.970 --> 23:27.990
Big trouble!

23:28.070 --> 23:31.090
What?! Kouhei's fighting against Hideaki?!

23:31.170 --> 23:31.970
Why?

23:32.040 --> 23:36.370
On top of all that, RI-ON's top man
Saizou Toki is also entering the battlefield?!

23:36.910 --> 23:39.670
Next, on Dragon Drive, "D-Z one".

23:39.750 --> 23:41.770
What?! Hideaki's true identity is!

23:41.850 --> 23:44.550
D-Z one
Buzz, buzz, buzz... bang!

23:44.550 --> 23:45.020
D-Z one
